2
00:00:05,159 --> 00:00:07,359
(Sheldon(on phone):)Hello, yes, I was hoping
you could help me.

3
00:00:07,361 --> 00:00:11,931
(Sheldon(on phone):)What song is this?
♪ La, la, la, la, la, la, la. ♪

4
00:00:11,933 --> 00:00:13,333
(Sheldon(on phone):)You don't know?

5
00:00:13,334 --> 00:00:14,804
(Sheldon(on phone):)Well, how dare you
call yourselves

6
00:00:14,802 --> 00:00:18,102
(Sheldon(on phone):)a Rock and Roll Hall of Fame?

7
00:00:18,105 --> 00:00:20,905
(Sheldon(on phone):)My goodness. Do you sing along
to the greatest hits

8
00:00:20,908 --> 00:00:23,208
(Sheldon(on phone):)of Elvis Presley
with that mouth?

9
00:00:23,211 --> 00:00:25,681
(Sheldon(on phone):)Well, they were no help at all.
Which is crazy,

10
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:29,720
(Leonard:)since rock and roll is all
about good customer service.

11
00:00:29,717 --> 00:00:31,747
(Penny:)Yeah. So you have a song
stuck in your head.

12
00:00:31,752 --> 00:00:33,022
(Penny:)It happens to everybody.

13
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:35,090
(Sheldon:)Well, I'm not everybody.
I have an eidetic memory.

14
00:00:35,089 --> 00:00:37,289
(Sheldon:)I should be able to remember
what song this is,

15
00:00:37,291 --> 00:00:38,221
(Sheldon:)but I can't.

16
00:00:38,226 --> 00:00:40,096
(Sheldon:)Something's wrong with me.

17
00:00:40,094 --> 00:00:43,164
(Penny:)I told you if we were patient,
he'd figure it out for himself.

18
00:00:43,164 --> 00:00:45,894
Oh... I was always afraid
this day would come.

19
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:49,500
(Sheldon:)This might be the first step
of my descent into madness,

20
00:00:49,504 --> 00:00:53,134
(Sheldon:)where I gradually test
the limits of public nudity.

21
00:00:53,975 --> 00:00:54,945
(Penny:)Public nudity?

22
00:00:54,942 --> 00:01:02,022
(Leonard:)Eh, that just means
going barefoot.

